      "adds region support when creating integrations in proxies allowing region specified endpoints and requiring region configuration in setintegrationrequest",
      "updates setintegrationrequest to support ref attributes for parameter values and adds explicit handling for empty element values as null",
      "enables testing an integration without publishing or creating a new version to validate input values and connection flow behavior",
      "adds new array transformation functions including filter and for each for processing array type variables in data mapping",
      "adds a filter clause option to connectors task operations to limit the amount of data processed during entity operations",
      "deprecates the apigee integration us multi region us location and directs new deployments to supported single regions",
      "adds nested function support to the data mapping task so one function can accept other functions as input parameters",
      "makes apigee integration available in additional regions including melbourne finland paris madrid doha and tel aviv",
      "makes apigee integrations available in apigee evaluation orgs so users can try the feature without billing charges",
      "adds support for iam conditions to enable attribute based access control on apigee integration resources",
      "introduces a return task to customize http error response messages during integration execution failures",
      "adds integration designer support for uploading and downloading integration definitions in json format",
      "introduces a vertex ai predict task for executing online predictions against machine learning models",
      "adds the ability to delete an entire integration and all associated versions in one operation",
      "adds the ability to view a detailed summary of an integration from the integration designer",
      "adds support for subfield mapping of json variables in the data mapping task variable list",
      "introduces an error catcher trigger to handle failures in a trigger task or edge condition",
      "introduces a data transformer function that converts a json object into an xml string",
      "introduces a data transformer function that parses an xml string into a json object",
      "adds cloud log visibility for failed connectors tasks in apigee integration",
      "us multi region location deprecation",
